    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583170/extras/51c6c3f993494d29f16216a95c4fbf50.avif?t=1743182636\" width=650 height=162 /></span><strong>The race is ready !\u00a0</strong><br><strong>Let's RUSH !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Reach the flag, complete the race and DON'T TOUCH ANYTHING!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four consecutive areas with different kind of obstacles !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow : Agility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green : Buoyancy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red : Survivability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue : Speed</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete the race and become a legend with the global or friend only leaderboard !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583170/extras/96d590fb79542e73e531202b0c8b0e41.avif?t=1743182636\" width=600 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583170/extras/3b7873f64785c10a58c10945b80d98c5.avif?t=1743182636\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
